  <div class="job-header">
    <span class="job-title"><strong>Lead Trainer, Concentrix Daksh</strong> – Gurugram, India</span>
    <span class="job-date">April 2022 – Aug 2025</span>
  </div>
  <ul>
    <li>Analyzed cross-functional workforce and operational datasets to uncover root-cause bottlenecks, driving <strong>process optimization initiatives</strong> that improved quality metrics by 84%.</li>
    <li>Designed interactive <strong>Tableau BI dashboards</strong> to track operational SLAs and performance KPIs, reducing stakeholder decision latency by 30%.</li>
